/ `steps` is empty for a driver with nothing planned that day, and steps.first was
/ then nil, so the whole route sheet answered 500. The controllers that render
/ this partial always load the daily quest, so fall back to it.
- close_quest = steps.first&.mission&.daily_quest || @daily_quest

.mb-3.space-y-3 data-controller="steps"
  = render partial: 'daily_quests/missions/step', collection: steps

  - if close_quest.present?
    = link_to t('common.close'),
              daily_quest_missions_path(close_quest),
              class: 'block underline text-sm text-center dark:text-white',
              data: { \
                controller: 'steps', \
                action: 'click->steps#close' \
              }
